<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Erreur {{ code }} - {{ name }}</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f4f5; color: #27272a;
            min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        main { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; max-width: 640px; }
        .code { font-size: 6rem; font-weight: 800; color: #dc2626; line-height: 1; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 1rem 0 .5rem; }
        p { color: #52525b; }
        .exception {
            margin: 1.5rem 0 0; padding: .75rem 1rem; text-align: left;
            background: #fee2e2; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
            font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", monospace; font-size: .85rem; color: #7f1d1d;
            word-break: break-word;
        }
        a {
            display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: .5rem 1.25rem;
            background: #27272a; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;
        }
        a:hover { background: #52525b; }
        footer { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: .8rem; color: #a1a1aa; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <p class="code">{{ code }}</p>
    <h1>Accès interdit</h1>
    <p>Vous n'avez pas les droits nécessaires pour accéder à cette page.</p>

    {% if exception_message %}
        <p class="exception">{{ exception_message }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    <a href="/">Retour à l'accueil</a>

    <footer>{{ name }}</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
